{"path":"/ja/tip/08-36","title":"被害者として賠償を請求する場合、12315、訴訟、または弁護士を通じて行い、相手と二人きりで会う約束をしないこと。「金を払えば、公表しない」という言い方をセットにしないこと | HowToLiveBetter","description":"被害者として加害者に賠償を請求すること自体には法的根拠があり、「請求額が高い」という理由だけで自動的に恐喝罪になることはありません。しかし、その代償は非常に大きくなる可能性があります。郭利氏は、一度恐喝罪で懲役5年の判決を受け、その後に再審で無罪が宣告されました。したがって、記録が残る手段をとり、…","lang":"ja","styles":["/sites/howtolivebetter/styles/bca54bebe9c1bd3b.css"],"bodyClass":"font-sans antialiased","nodes":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-site"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-header-slot","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[]},{"tag":"header","props":{"className":"life-header"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-header-inner"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-brand","aria-label":"H ✳ HowToLiveBetter ホーム","href":"/ja"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-brand-mark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["H",{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["✳"]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["HowToLive",{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Better"]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-nav","aria-label":"メインナビゲーション"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/ja/book"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["本を読む"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/ja/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["厳選50"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/ja/daily"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["今日のタスク"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/ja/dashboard"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["マイリスト"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-nav-link life-nav-more","aria-haspopup":"menu","aria-expanded":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["その他"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWi